  "[says] (to O-lan) Wang Lung apologizes, feeling ashamed of his behavior.",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"I have been a fool and a brute. I shall buy the woman a pin of gold, as she is my little heart, and perhaps I shall buy a little basket for her father and a red paper for her mother, and a new robe for her little brother, and gold thread for her little sister's eyes.\"",
